<section class="route brain trader" data-route-view data-route-key="<%= page.route.key %>" data-brain>
  <header class="brain-header">
    <div class="brain-heading"><h1>AGENT BRAIN<span class="brain-terminal-cursor" aria-hidden="true">_</span></h1><span>OMEN / NEURAL INTERFACE</span></div>
    <div class="brain-header-actions">
      <button type="button" class="brain-refresh-button" data-brain-map-refresh aria-label="Refresh workspace">Refresh</button>
      <button type="button" class="btn" data-brain-map-demo disabled>RUN DEMO</button>
      <button type="button" class="btn btn-solid" data-brain-open-mission>NEW MISSION <span aria-hidden="true">↗</span></button>
    </div>
    <output class="toast" hidden data-toast></output>
  </header>

  <div class="brain-toolbar">
    <div class="brain-tabs" role="tablist" aria-label="Agent workspace">
      <button type="button" id="brain-tab-network" role="tab" aria-controls="brain-panel-network" aria-selected="true" data-brain-view="network">Network</button>
      <button type="button" id="brain-tab-mission" role="tab" aria-controls="brain-panel-mission" aria-selected="false" tabindex="-1" data-brain-view="mission">Mission <span class="brain-review-count" data-brain-review-count hidden></span></button>
      <button type="button" id="brain-tab-knowledge" role="tab" aria-controls="brain-panel-knowledge" aria-selected="false" tabindex="-1" data-brain-view="knowledge">Knowledge</button>
      <button type="button" id="brain-tab-checks" role="tab" aria-controls="brain-panel-checks" aria-selected="false" tabindex="-1" data-brain-view="checks">Checks</button>
    </div>
    <span class="brain-workspace-label">OMENSITE / AI</span>
  </div>
  <p class="brain-cost-lock" data-brain-cost-lock role="status">Paid AI calls locked. Offline demo and checks are available.</p>

  <section id="brain-panel-network" class="brain-view brain-network-view" data-brain-panel="network" role="tabpanel" aria-labelledby="brain-tab-network" tabindex="0">
    <p class="brain-map-feedback" data-brain-map-feedback role="status"></p>
    <div data-brain-network></div>
    <details class="brain-flow-guide">
      <summary><span>HOW THE BRAIN WORKS</span><span class="brain-flow-preview" aria-hidden="true">MISSION <i>›</i> PLAN <i>›</i> RESEARCH <i>›</i> VERIFY <i>›</i> REVIEW</span><span class="brain-flow-expand" aria-hidden="true">+</span></summary>
      <ol class="brain-flow-steps">
        <li><b>01</b><div><h3>Give it a mission</h3><p>Set an objective, dated market context, and risk limits. Choose the provider for each agent.</p></div></li>
        <li><b>02</b><div><h3>Build the plan</h3><p>The planner breaks your objective into research, strategy, and critique tasks.</p></div></li>
        <li><b>03</b><div><h3>Gather evidence</h3><p>The researcher uses allowed tools to read context and retrieve cited knowledge, approved memories, and available journal entries. Each observation informs its next step.</p></div></li>
        <li><b>04</b><div><h3>Propose & check risk</h3><p>The strategist builds a thesis. Server checks verify its sources, required data, position sizing, and risk limits.</p></div></li>
        <li><b>05</b><div><h3>Challenge the thesis</h3><p>The critic reviews the proposal and can request a revision or recommend waiting. It cannot override the risk checks.</p></div></li>
        <li><b>06</b><div><h3>You decide what stays</h3><p>Accepting saves the exact reviewed research to memory for later retrieval. Rejecting ends the run. No broker orders are placed.</p></div></li>
      </ol>
      <p class="brain-flow-note">RUN DEMO uses scripted decisions and illustrative prices with zero AI tokens. The animated network is a visual interface; mission activity and provider usage are recorded separately.</p>
    </details>
  </section>

  <section id="brain-panel-mission" class="brain-view" data-brain-panel="mission" role="tabpanel" aria-labelledby="brain-tab-mission" tabindex="0" hidden>
    <div class="brain-workspace">
      <section class="panel brain-config" aria-labelledby="brain-mission-title">
        <header class="trader-panel-head"><h2 id="brain-mission-title">MISSION CONTROL</h2><span class="trader-micro">INPUT</span></header>
        <form data-brain-form>
          <label class="field">OBJECTIVE<textarea name="objective" rows="3" minlength="10" maxlength="1200" required>Evaluate the supplied market setup, retrieve relevant lessons, and challenge the thesis before human review.</textarea></label>
          <label class="field">DEFAULT PROVIDER<select name="provider"><option value="gemini">Gemini</option><option value="openai">OpenAI</option><option value="claude">Claude</option></select></label>
          <p class="brain-provider-note" data-brain-provider>Checking server configuration…</p>
          <div class="trader-form-grid">
            <label class="field">SYMBOL<input name="symbol" value="ES" maxlength="24" required></label>
            <label class="field">TIMEFRAME<select name="timeframe"><option value="1m">1 minute</option><option value="5m">5 minutes</option><option value="15m" selected>15 minutes</option><option value="1h">1 hour</option><option value="4h">4 hours</option><option value="1d">1 day</option></select></label>
          </div>
          <label class="field">MARKET CONTEXT<textarea name="context" rows="5" minlength="40" maxlength="12000" placeholder="Paste dated observations, OHLC data, price levels, and session context." required></textarea></label>
          <p class="trader-help">When paid access is enabled, analysis sends your context and relevant saved excerpts to the selected providers. Prices are supplied by you.</p>
          <details class="brain-settings"><summary>Risk parameters <span>Account, position sizing, and reward / risk</span></summary>
            <div class="trader-form-grid">
              <label class="field">ACCOUNT ($)<input name="accountSize" type="number" min="0.01" max="1000000000" step="0.01" value="50000" required></label>
              <label class="field">RISK (%)<input name="riskPercent" type="number" min="0.01" max="5" step="0.01" value="0.5" required></label>
              <label class="field">VALUE / POINT ($)<input name="pointValue" type="number" min="0.000001" max="1000000" step="any" value="50" required></label>
              <label class="field">MIN. REWARD / RISK<input name="minRewardRisk" type="number" min="1" max="20" step="0.1" value="2" required></label>
            </div>
          </details>
          <details class="brain-settings"><summary>Routing & limits <span>4 agent roles</span></summary>
            <p class="trader-help">Each role has its own working context. Choose a different provider for independent critique.</p>
            <div class="trader-form-grid">
              <% for (const role of ['planner', 'researcher', 'strategist', 'critic']) { %>
                <label class="field"><%= role.toUpperCase() %><select name="route_<%= role %>"><option value="">Use default</option><option value="gemini">Gemini</option><option value="openai">OpenAI</option><option value="claude">Claude</option></select></label>
              <% } %>
              <label class="field">MAX. STEPS<input name="maxSteps" type="number" min="1" max="24" value="12" required></label>
              <label class="field">MODEL CALLS<input name="maxModelCalls" type="number" min="1" max="16" value="10" required></label>
              <label class="field">TOKEN BUDGET<input name="maxTokens" type="number" min="1000" max="128000" value="64000" required></label>
              <label class="field">TIME LIMIT (SEC)<input name="durationSeconds" type="number" min="1" max="180" value="120" required></label>
              <label class="field">COST CAP ($)<input name="maxCostUsd" type="number" min="0.001" max="10" step="0.001" placeholder="Optional"></label>
            </div>
            <p class="trader-help">A dollar cap requires server pricing for every routed provider. Token and time limits apply to every run.</p>
          </details>
          <div class="trader-actions"><button type="submit" class="btn btn-solid" data-brain-start disabled>START MISSION ↗</button><button type="button" class="btn" data-brain-demo>RUN DEMO</button></div>
          <p class="trader-demo-help">Demo exercises the workflow with scripted decisions and fictional prices. No API key required.</p>
        </form>
      </section>
      <div class="brain-output">
        <section class="panel" aria-labelledby="brain-run-title">
          <header class="trader-panel-head"><h2 id="brain-run-title">WORKFLOW & REVIEW</h2><span class="trader-badge" data-brain-status>IDLE</span></header>
          <div class="brain-metrics" data-brain-metrics aria-label="Run metrics"></div>
          <div class="brain-run-content">
            <div class="brain-empty" data-brain-empty><div class="brain-loop" aria-hidden="true">[ ↻ ]</div><h3>Give the system a mission.</h3><p>A planner decomposes the task. Research and strategy agents gather evidence and build a thesis. A critic challenges it. You decide what to keep.</p><div class="brain-role-preview"><span>01 / PLANNER</span><span>02 / RESEARCHER</span><span>03 / STRATEGIST</span><span>04 / CRITIC</span></div></div>
            <div data-brain-graph class="brain-graph" aria-label="Workflow graph"></div>
            <div data-brain-result></div>
            <div class="brain-approval" data-brain-approval hidden><h3>Human review required</h3><p>Accepting saves this research to your agent’s memory. Review its evidence, missing data, and risk checks first.</p><label class="field">REVIEW NOTE<textarea name="approvalNote" data-brain-note maxlength="1000" rows="2" placeholder="Record your decision or a correction."></textarea></label><div class="brain-button-row"><button type="button" class="btn btn-solid" data-brain-approve>ACCEPT & SAVE MEMORY</button><button type="button" class="btn" data-brain-reject>REJECT</button></div></div>
            <button type="button" class="btn brain-cancel" data-brain-cancel hidden>CANCEL RUN</button>
          </div>
          <p class="brain-feedback" role="status" aria-live="polite" data-brain-feedback>Connecting to the agent runtime…</p>
        </section>
        <section class="panel" aria-labelledby="brain-trace-title"><header class="trader-panel-head"><h2 id="brain-trace-title">EXECUTION TRACE</h2><span class="trader-micro">ACTIONS + EVIDENCE</span></header><ol class="brain-trace" data-brain-trace><li class="brain-placeholder">Tool calls, handoffs, verification, and timing appear here.</li></ol></section>
        <section class="panel"><header class="trader-panel-head"><h2>RECENT MISSIONS</h2><button type="button" class="trader-text-button" data-brain-refresh>Refresh</button></header><div class="brain-history" data-brain-history><p class="brain-placeholder">No missions yet.</p></div></section>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section id="brain-panel-knowledge" class="brain-view" data-brain-panel="knowledge" role="tabpanel" aria-labelledby="brain-tab-knowledge" tabindex="0" hidden>
    <section class="panel brain-library" aria-labelledby="brain-memory-title">
      <header class="trader-panel-head"><h2 id="brain-memory-title">KNOWLEDGE & MEMORY</h2><span class="trader-micro" data-brain-document-count>0 SOURCES</span></header>
      <div class="brain-library-body">
        <div class="brain-library-intro"><h3>Give your agents context.</h3><p class="trader-help">Add a playbook or a trading lesson. Agents retrieve relevant excerpts with citations. Accepted research is saved here automatically.</p></div>
        <div class="brain-library-workspace">
          <form data-brain-document-form>
            <div class="brain-document-inputs"><label class="field">SOURCE TITLE<input name="title" maxlength="200" required placeholder="e.g. ES session playbook"></label><label class="field">TYPE<select name="kind"><option value="knowledge">Knowledge</option></select></label></div>
            <label class="field">SOURCE TEXT<textarea name="text" rows="8" maxlength="50000" required placeholder="Write or paste the source material…"></textarea></label>
            <button class="btn" type="submit">ADD SOURCE</button>
            <p class="brain-feedback" data-brain-library-feedback role="status"></p>
          </form>
          <div class="brain-saved-sources"><h3>SAVED SOURCES</h3><div class="brain-documents" data-brain-documents></div></div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>
  </section>

  <section id="brain-panel-checks" class="brain-view" data-brain-panel="checks" role="tabpanel" aria-labelledby="brain-tab-checks" tabindex="0" hidden>
    <div class="brain-checks-workspace">
      <section class="panel brain-readiness" aria-labelledby="brain-readiness-title">
        <header class="trader-panel-head"><h2 id="brain-readiness-title">SETUP READINESS</h2><a class="trader-text-button" href="#brain-evals-title">Offline checks ↓</a></header>
        <div class="brain-readiness-body">
          <p class="trader-help">API keys alone cannot enable paid calls. Verify the system here before enabling provider access on the server.</p>
          <ul class="brain-readiness-checks" data-brain-readiness-checks><li class="brain-placeholder">Checking the current setup…</li></ul>
          <p class="brain-readiness-time" data-brain-readiness-time></p>
        </div>
      </section>
      <section class="panel" aria-labelledby="brain-evals-title">
        <header class="trader-panel-head"><h2 id="brain-evals-title">SYSTEM EVALUATIONS</h2><span class="trader-micro">OFFLINE SUITE</span></header>
        <div class="brain-evals-body"><h3>Verify the controls.</h3><p>Run deterministic scenarios against the agent system: workflow, risk checks, tool permissions, retrieval, memory, and approval rules.</p><button type="button" class="btn" data-brain-evals>RUN EVALUATIONS</button><div data-brain-eval-results role="status"></div><p class="trader-help">No provider calls. These checks test system behavior; they do not measure trading performance or live model quality.</p></div>
      </section>
    </div>
  </section>
</section>
